# Summary

Books are lent to members under the terms of the loan table of these bylaws[[cite:obs-d6293371e4fd810708de648f0f253eabc42d75ae "Books are lent to members under the terms of the loan table of these bylaws."]].

Novels may be kept for twenty-one days and this period is renewable twice[[cite:obs-33d3ca4344f260c5e0924fd9facaf722d8c5e5bb "Novels: twenty-one days, renewable twice."]].
